Z||000013||Sour Lemon||12-04-2001||06:43 PM||||I have a few issues with the stock 4-speed auto...<BR>I'd really like to avoid the extra weight that tranny offers.<BR>I want to go with an aftermarket computer too,  I think that I would be able to tune it a little better.  <BR>My project is still in the planning stages.<BR>I'm not sure if the stock computer will be able to handle the mods I'd like to do(turbocharge, heads/cams from chrfab)<BR>||||reg||1
